  "channel": "rent",
  "description": "Offering an impressive combination of space, privacy, recent upgrades and outstanding convenience, this beautifully maintained 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home presents nicely.<br/><br/>Positioned in the heart of Joondalup, the property has been thoughtfully refreshed throughout and is ready to simply move in and enjoy. With fresh paint inside and out, new hybrid flooring to all three bedrooms, updated kitchen cabinetry and new roller blinds throughout, much of the hard work has already been done.<br/><br/>At the heart of the home is a well-designed living and dining area complemented by a functional kitchen with new cupboards and drawers, providing a fresh and practical space for everyday living.<br/><br/>All three bedrooms are generously proportioned and have been upgraded with new hybrid flooring, creating a clean, modern and low-maintenance finish. The home also offers two bathrooms, making it ideal for families, couples or those wanting additional space for guests.<br/><br/>For year-round comfort, the property is equipped with two split-system air-conditioning units.<br/><br/>One of the standout features is the generous private paved courtyard wrapping around the rear and side of the home. Offering plenty of room to relax, entertain or create your own outdoor retreat, it provides a fantastic extension of the indoor living space while remaining private and easy to maintain.<br/><br/>Adding further convenience is the rear-access double lock-up garage, providing secure parking for two vehicles and excellent accessibility.<br/><br/>Property Features<br/>Three spacious bedrooms<br/>Two bathrooms<br/>Rear-access double lock-up garage<br/>Spacious and private paved rear and side courtyard<br/>Freshly repainted internally and externally<br/>New hybrid flooring to all three bedrooms<br/>New kitchen cupboards and drawers<br/>New roller blinds to all windows<br/>Two split-system air-conditioning units<br/>Functional, low-maintenance design<br/>Excellent indoor and outdoor living<br/>Ideal for owner-occupiers, retirees, downsizers or investors<br/>Move-in-ready presentation<br/>A Location That Is Hard to Beat<br/><br/>The convenience of this location is a major drawcard. Perfectly positioned in central Joondalup, you'll have an incredible range of amenities within easy reach.<br/><br/>Joondalup Health Campus is approximately 300 metres away, making this an especially appealing location for health professionals, investors or anyone wanting easy access to the hospital precinct.<br/><br/>For those who enjoy the outdoors, beautiful Yellagonga Regional Park is approximately a five-minute walk away, offering walking trails, natural surrounds and plenty of space to enjoy an active lifestyle.<br/><br/>Joondalup city centre is approximately 600 metres away, putting shopping, cafés, restaurants, entertainment, services and everyday conveniences practically on your doorstep.<br/><br/>With its combination of recent improvements, generous outdoor space, secure double garaging and a highly convenient central Joondalup location, this is a property with broad appeal and plenty to offer.<br/><br/>Move in, relax and enjoy everything Joondalup has to offer.<br/><br/>***Please note the lessor makes no representations about the availability of telephone lines, internet lines or any other communications services to the premises. The tenant must make their own enquiries regarding the availability, cost and/or installation of those services.<br/> <br/>***TO ARRANGE A VIEWING PLEASE CLICK ON THE 'CONTACT THE AGENT' BUTTON OR THE 'BOOK INSPECTION' BUTTON AND YOU WILL BE SENT AN INSTANT REPLY TO REGISTER FOR THE SCHEDULED VIEWING/S***<br/> <br/>***BEWARE OF SCAMS ONLY ARRANGE PROPERTY VIEWINGS THROUGH US, NOT DIRECTLY WITH ANYONE CLAIMING TO BE THE OWNER.<br/> <br/>***HOME OPEN TIMES ARE SUBJECT TO CHANGE WITHOUT NOTICE.*** Please be on time so you have sufficient time to fully view the property and ensure that it meets your requirements as viewing times cannot be extended, so as not to cause delays for the next home open. See You There.**<br/> <br/>***ARE YOU A LANDLORD? If you are looking for property management services, we would love to hear from you. Contact our office at 9325 0700 or hello@ljhpxp.com.au for a no-obligation and confidential conversation.",
